exrcreator: include ImfHeader.h

EXRCreator::create() uses Imf::Header, which it only gets through
ImfInputFile.h.  The OpenEXR of Fedora 45 includes ImfHeader.h there,
OpenEXR 3.2 (Fedora 44) only declares the class: "invalid use of
incomplete type 'const class Imf_3_2::Header'".  To be dropped once
kde3-kdebase includes the header itself.

--- a/kioslave/thumbnail/exrcreator.cpp
+++ b/kioslave/thumbnail/exrcreator.cpp
@@ -25,6 +25,7 @@
 #include <kglobal.h>
 #include <qfile.h>
 
+#include <ImfHeader.h>
 #include <ImfInputFile.h>
 #include <ImfPreviewImage.h>
 
